      "name": "Soul Drain",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/sword.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The ur'zul targets one creature within 5 feet of it or one of its tendrils. The target must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw, taking 14 (4d6) necrotic damage, or half as much on a success. the ur'zul regains hit points equal to the necrotic damage dealt, and the target's hit point maximum is reduced by an amount equal to the necrotic damage taken. This reduction last until the target finishes a long rest. The target dies if its hit point maximum is reduced to 0, and any creature that dies in this way is sucked into the ur'zul's body.</p>",
